/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Planning & Design: Defined objectives, gathered requirements, and designed a modular architecture using Flask, YOLOv8, and Chart.js. Development & Integration: Implemented live video streaming, zone drawing, and detection modules. Integrated tracking, alert logic, and secure user authentication. Dashboard & Visualization: Built an interactive dashboard to display real-time counts, zone statistics, and alerts. Added admin features for camera setup and data export. Testing & Deployment: Tested system accuracy, stability, and dashboard performance. Deployed the final application on a local Flask server for demonstration. Enhancements: Included analytics visualization, CSV/PDF exports, and final documentation for project submission.)
/E (Planning & Design: Defined objectives, gathered requirements, and designed a modular architecture using Flask, YOLOv8, and Chart.js. Development & Integration: Implemented live video streaming, zone drawing, and detection modules. Integrated tracking, alert logic, and secure user authentication. Dashboard & Visualization: Built an interactive dashboard to display real-time counts, zone statistics, and alerts. Added admin features for camera setup and data export. Testing & Deployment: Tested system accuracy, stability, and dashboard performance. Deployed the final application on a local Flask server for demonstration. Enhancements: Included analytics visualization, CSV/PDF exports, and final documentation for project submission.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6 7]
